window.products.push({"id":163138,"name":"2Pcs 3 Pin QP2-4.7/ QP2-4R7 4.7 Ohm Refrigerator PTC Start Relay Compressor Starter Relay Replacement Part Compatible with Vissani, EdgeStar, Danby, K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fPA1y52yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Package Included】You will get 2pcs QP2-4R7 3-pin PTC Starter Relays, convenient to replace the old or broken part of your refrigerator.【Note】Please carefully compare the pictures we provide with your old parts. Please check if your old relay is 3-pin. To make sure it fits your refrigerator. please consider before buying. 【Compatible models】PTC starter relay can suitable for most brands in the market that uses 3 Pins QP02-4.7 ohm resistor relay. Nice to replace part numbers like QP02-4R7, QP02-4.7, QP02-4.7G12, WS-EP14F, 3990100070, 6R8MD3, AP4565041, 1206682. 【Save Time & Money】Prepared for some common problems, such as compressor is not starting, burning hot and \"click-clack\" about every 3-5 minutes when powered on. Very easy to install and inexpensive way to replace or repair your refrigerator / freezer / air-conditioning compressor, save a lot of money from buying a new refrigerator. 【Premium Quality】The refrigerator start relay is made of high-quality plastic + brass materials. Better than most tinned materials, responsive, durable, high reliability and has a long service life. Ideal replacement parts for refrigerator to replace old one. Pin Number: 3Pin. Relay overall size: 1.1'' x 0.83'' x 1.18''(L*W*H). Resistance: 4.7 ohm. 【Widely Applicable】The PTC Starter Relay is suitable for the maintenance and assembly of various brands of refrigerator/freezer/air conditioner compressors. Such as the most mini fridges, compact refrigerators, car refrigerator, portable freezer, beverage & wine coolers, deep freezers, beer fridge. Compatible with Vissani, Danby, EdgeStar, Summit, Whirlpool, Frgidaire, Koldfront, LG, Kenmore, Haier, Igloo, Magic Chef, Summerset outdoor refrigerator, etc other brands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fPA1y52yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XFYBZN","source_asin":"B0B7GDDCFL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-163138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7GDDCFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7GDDCFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
