window.products.push({"id":163212,"name":"Lehman's Manual Clothes Washer Plunger, Portable Breathing Washing Agitator for Bucket, Sink or Tub","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GuYeaGlcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Discover Our Hand Clothes Washer Plunger. Take our breathing mobile washer anywhere and get your laundry done. Plunge up and down to force soap and water through clothes and linens - it's that simple. Faster, more economical and much more efficient than traditional hand washing, and it just may get your clothes cleaner than an electric or gas-powered machine. Reduces wear on clothes and saves water, too. No electricity needed (all you need is a little arm power). Collapsible design means you can take it with you easily - great for the campsite, RVs, apartments, power outages and more. 3-piece collapsible handle with heavy duty metal threads. Named \"breathing\" washer because of the sound it makes as its unique action effectively pushes and pulls soap and water through your clothes. Use in a bucket (5-gallon suggested), sink or tub. You can also rinse your clothes using fresh water.. Heavy-duty plastic agitator and splash guard. Drawstring storage bag included. When assembled 31-3/4\"H. How It Works: Our hand-operated clothes washer uses a technique of pushing and pulling water through clothes opposed to top and front loading washing machines that only splashes water around or the harsh scrubbing of a washboard resulting in a superior clean with less wear and tear. Features of Breathing Hand Washer: 3-piece collapsible handle for convenient transport and storage. Just use the included drawstring storage bag to keep all the pieces in one place. T-handle for ergonomic use. Uses minimal water and less soap. Aluminum will last for years. Ideal for campers, RV users and college students washing small loads of laundry anytime, safely cleans delicate items. Also great for washing clothes during power outages. Environmentally conscious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GuYeaGlcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lehman's","source_asin":"B0C7D12TQ8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-163212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7D12TQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7D12TQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
