window.products.push({"id":163241,"name":"49mm Coffee Portafilter Puck Screen - Espresso Screen, Reusable Coffee Filter Replacement, 1.7mm Lower Shower Contact Plate Screen, Perfect Mesh Espre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S3+ZOUyoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Better Extraction: The espresso puck screen it's a perfect distribution tool to help with the care of your espresso machine, by keeping the grounds from back-flushing into your machine as much. Also more evenly dispersing the hot water over your grounds, control splatter making a better shot and the coffee powder will be full extracted,and then you will get a cup of richer and smoother coffee. Keeps Your Shower Head Clean: Adding this espresso filter screen for your coffee routine, your went from having slightly wet pucks to perfectly dry and flat pucks, which makes cleanup so easy. The puck screen separates your puck from your shower head. As a result, you won’t need to pull the gasket and screen every day or two to remove coffee residue from the screen and to clear the groove around the inside edge of the head. Product Specifications:The coffee filter is made of the high-quality and non-toxic 316 stainless steel 150μm puck filter screen. Don't worry about the filter getting rusty ,it's highly durable,corrosion-resistant, perfectly safe to reusable.The 49mm puck screen Compatible with Espresso Machine 49mm Portafilter Basket. Accurate size perfectly matched with your Espresso Portafilter.It is worth noting that the Shower Head has screw protrusions and is not suitable for this espresso mesh screen. Easy to Clean: Do you think it would be troublesome to clean this espresso puck filter? In fact, its cleaning is surprisingly simple, you just need to quick rinse under the faucet or soak in water to cleanly remove the internal residue, then wipe dry and place it. This only takes 30 seconds to obtain a clean coffee espresso mesh and can be reused for a long time. The Ideal Gift for Coffee Lovers: The puck mesh for espresso is a ideal gift for coffee lovers, It's great value for money, made the shot more accurate and with less channeling and make the group head filter less dirty,there's no more trouble with cleaning anymore. This is very important for coffee enthusiasts. Simply add a espresso stainless mesh made your espresso even better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S3+ZOUyoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dbround","source_asin":"B0BZL91B8J","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-163241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZL91B8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZL91B8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
