window.products.push({"id":163703,"name":"Sealegend 2 Pieces Dryer Vent Cleaner Kit New Upgrade Dryer Lint Brush Vent Cleaner Vacuum Attachment, No Noise Vacuum Hose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iso4eky6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【New Upgrade】According to customer feedback on similar products, this new upgrade of our clenaer tube is designed to solve the noise problem during customer use. After many tests, the thread of our cleaning tube is different from other similar ones, which can effectively reduce the noise problem caused by the suction power. 【Dryer Vent Vacuum Attachment Hose with Brush】: These dryer duct cleaning tools connect to a vacuum handle or hose to use suction to remove lints. They can be vacuum attachments flat hose, this shape hoses are specially designed to the narrow vents of dryer.Don't worry about the corner you can't clean. 【Remove Lint Build-up】 -Break lints loose with the brush and hookup your vacuum to get rid of the loose particles lints. Sealegend dryer vent cleaner kit work with vacuum can help to removes lint that has accumulated for many years in the dryer vents, help your equipment runs more efficiently.If your dryer has accumulated large pieces of lints, then during use, you need to remove the lint that is adsorbed on the end of the hose in time 【Potential Hidden Hazards】If you're having dryer issues, the problem may not be your appliance — you might just have a ton of lint buildup going on in there. Before you run out and blow hundreds of bucks on a new unit, grab the Sealegend Dryer Vent Cleaner Kit. It'll do just what its name says, and it just may make your dryer run a lot more efficiently — and certainly more safely by preventing deadly vent fires from sparking. 【Try the Exceptional Performance of Dryer Vent Cleaning Combination】This innovative tool effortlessly removes dust and debris accumulation from your vents, guaranteeing optimal efficiency and durability for your appliance. By investing in this superior product, you are not only enhancing the value of your home but also reaping long-lasting benefits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iso4eky6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sealegend","source_asin":"B0CFQGFBPM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-163703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CFQGFBPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CFQGFBPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
