window.products.push({"id":163962,"name":"LG AEQ73209906 Refrigerator Ice Maker Genuine Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM) Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":174.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IadEYoniL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Genuine Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM) parts! This ice maker (part number AEQ73209906) is for refrigerators. Ice maker AEQ73209906 includes the ice mold and the control device. The ice maker receives water from the water inlet valve and then holds the water in the ice mold until the water freezes solid. It then automatically ejects the ice and refills to continue the process until the ice storage in is full. Safely store any food that could deteriorate while the power is off and unplug the refrigerator when installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IadEYoniL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B07QNRRHJG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-163962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QNRRHJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QNRRHJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":163963,"name":"4 Pack Drip Pans, Replacement Chrome Drip Pans for Whirlpool Frigidaire Kenmore Electric Stove with Locking Slots - Includes 2 Small 6’’ and 2 Large 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IOmRW8FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Set of 4 Drip pans]: Our burner pans include 2 6inches drip bowls and 2 8inches universal drip pans. There are replacement chrome drip pans’ dimension: 6’’ drip pans diameter measured 7.48inch, 8’’ drip pans diameter measured 9.53inch. So please carefully check your Cooking Stove size before buying. [Premium Quality & Perfect Craft]: Each burner pans is made of premium quality steel with chrome finish. Our electric stove drip pans surface is made up of aluminum material, durable nickel and high-quality electroplating. Our replacement chrome drip pans adopt advanced firing technology, the two sides of the pan feel smooth, no obvious defects, to ensure lasting and effective performance. [Excellent Performance] : When the cooker leaks, the drip pans at the top of the burner stove catches the spill and breaks. By using a stove plate, you can extend the service life of kitchenware and avoid direct contact with the pot during cooking. In addition, you can save even more money and energy by recycling the electric stove drip tray. [Easy to Clean & Maintenance] : Our electric stove burner drip pans is very easy to clean. You can put the drip pans in the sink and clean it with water, or you can put it in the dishwasher. It's very safe. Of course, in order to make your electric stove burner drip pot live longer, it is recommended to wipe off the stain immediately after cooking and keep it dry to avoid liquid attachment to the burner pot. [Easy to install] Burner drip tray can be replaced without tools. Simply remove the burner element and then remove the old bowl. Next, line up the pot holes with the terminals and place them in place. Make sure the bowl is flat before reinstalling the component.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IOmRW8FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elipenico","source_asin":"B0BQYTD31F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-163963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQYTD31F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQYTD31F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
